('格物快讯黑', 'WECHAT', 'WECHAT_OFFICIAL_ACCOUNT', NULL,
'{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://picsum.photos/800/400","alt":"新闻封面"}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"right"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"发布日期：2026年6月26日 ｜ 来源："},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://spacemv.com"}}],"text":"SpaceMV新闻中心"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"核心导读： "},{"type":"text","text":"自然资源部今日发布《关于推进卫星遥感数据在农业农村领域应用的指导意见》，明确将卫星遥感纳入农业保险、种植补贴核定和粮食安全监测的官方数据源。这是我国首次在政策层面确立遥感数据的行政效力。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://picsum.photos/600/350","alt":"发布会现场"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"事件经过"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"6月26日上午，自然资源部联合农业农村部召开新闻发布会，正式发布"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"《指导意见》"},{"type":"text","text":"。文件明确：即日起，卫星遥感影像数据可作为农业保险定损、种植面积核定、粮食产量估算的法定参考依据。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"时间线："}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"2024年3月："},{"type":"text","text":"试点启动，选取黑龙江、河南、四川三省份开展遥感数据应用试点"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"2025年9月："},{"type":"text","text":"试点评估报告完成，遥感数据准确率达94.7%"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"2026年6月："},{"type":"text","text":"《指导意见》正式发布，全国推广"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"各方观点"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"官方表态："},{"type":"text","text":"自然资源部国土卫星遥感应用中心表示，目前已实现全国2米分辨率影像季度全覆盖，重点区域月度覆盖，具备大规模业务化服务能力。"}]},{"type":"blockquote","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"text":""这是一次数据基础制度的重大创新。遥感数据从科研工具转变为行政依据，将显著提升农业补贴发放的精准度和效率。""}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"text":"—— 自然资源部国土卫星遥感应用中心 张建国副主任"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"市场反应："},{"type":"text","text":"受政策利好影响，卫星遥感相关企业股价今日普遍上涨。SpaceMV平台用户咨询量环比增长300%，农业保险公司、种植企业和金融机构对遥感数据的需求显著增加。"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"https://picsum.photos/600/350","alt":"市场数据图表"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"关键数据"}]},{"type":"orderedList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"试点覆盖率："},{"type":"text","text":"3省25县，覆盖耕地面积1,200万亩"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"定损准确率："},{"type":"text","text":"94.7%（人工核查为97.2%）"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"补贴核减率："},{"type":"text","text":"试点区域虚报面积核减12.3%，节约财政资金约4.7亿元"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"趋势分析"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"随着《指导意见》落地，预计未来三年内"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"},{"type":"underline"}],"text":"全国超过80%的农业保险业务"},{"type":"text","text":"将引入卫星遥感定损机制。SpaceMV正积极推进与中国人保、太平洋保险等机构的系统对接，为农业保险数字化转型提供数据基座。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"参考链接："}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.mnr.gov.cn/zwgk/202606/t20260626_2854897.html"}}],"text":"自然资源部《指导意见》全文"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://spacemv.com/reports/remote-sensing-agri-2026"}}],"text":"SpaceMV深度解读：卫星遥感数据在农业保险中的实战应用"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"编辑：陈思远"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"审核：王建国"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"END"}]}]}',
